# CASE Index Template

Purpose:
  Index of all CASE specifications within a MODULE.
  Provides a navigable tree of depends-on and related relationships.

Owns: templates\_sdd\project\case-index.template.sdd

## Module Overview

Module: {MODULE_ID}
Module_Name: {module display name}
Layer: {layer}
Cases: {count}

## Case Registry

Cases:
  - CASE: {CASE_ID}
    Name: {CASE_NAME}
    File: ./{case_file}.sdd
    Status: {status}
    Depends_On:
      - {DEPENDS_ON_CASE_ID} [{✅|🔄|⏳}]
    Related:
      - {RELATED_CASE_ID} [{✅|🔄|⏳}]

## Flow Tree

Flow_Index:
  {CASE_ID_01} ({CASE_NAME_01})
    ├── depends-on: {DEPENDS_ON_ID} [{✅|🔄|⏳}]
    └── related: {RELATED_ID} [{✅|🔄|⏳}]

